TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} ile çok vakit geçiriyor musun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Biz henüz pek kaynaşamadık.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Belki sadece biraz daha birlikte vakit
geçirmemiz gerekiyordur!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I got {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
from {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It was such a delightful surprise
that my heart started pounding!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Şuna bak!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} kişisinden bir mektup
aldım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kendisi {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
kasabasında yaşıyor!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ieri {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ho sistemato delle cose{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
che ho portato qui da {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
e mi è venuta un po' di nostalgia...
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Mi chiedo come stia {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}...
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Passavamo moltissimissimo tempo
insieme e ci divertivamo tanto!
Immagino abbia ancora{{TAG:0003:0001:}} quell'aria
da {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0011:0004:0000}}
che ha sempre avuto!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich habe Lust, mal wieder die
Stadtmelodie von {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
zu singen! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Los geht's! {{TAG:000D:0003:00CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È una lettera che mi hai scritto tu,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi è piaciuta così tanto{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
che la rileggo{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} una volta al giorno!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ti preeego, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}scrivimi più spesso!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non vedo l'ora di ricevere
tantissimissime lettere da te!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu senden gelen bir mektup, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Beni öyle mutlu ediyor ki,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} bazen çıkarıp
yeniden okuyorum.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Lütfen bana daha çok mektup gönder!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mektup almayı çok seviyorum.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ganz schön tiefgründig, oder?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Das ist einer meiner Lieblingsbriefe,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cette lettre lui ressemble bien !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
C'est un vrai plaisir de la lire, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}j'ai
l'impression d'être à ses côtés.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non riesco a spiegarlo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ma in questa
lettera c'è così tanto sentimento...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Io la adoooro!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Have you ever heard that before?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Humming that tune makes me feel
so alive!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿La habías oído antes?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Yo siempre me noto más llena de
energía cuando canto esa canción.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}L'avevi{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} mai sentito?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ogni volta che lo canto, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}mi si
riempie il cuore di energia positiva!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kennst du die Melodie schon?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ich bin immer viel aufgeweckter,
wenn ich sie gesummt habe.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bunu daha önce hiç duydun mu?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Bu melodiyi mırıldanmak kendimi
capcanlı hissettiriyor!
